# Public site URL — used for canonical URLs, sitemap and Open Graph tags.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://www.nosvra.com

# Resend (https://resend.com/api-keys) — used by app/api/contact/route.ts to send
# contact form enquiries. Server-only: never prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxxxxxxxxxxx

# Optional. Must be on a domain verified in your Resend account — until you verify
# one, leave this unset and Resend's sandbox sender (onboarding@resend.dev) is used,
# which can only deliver to the email you signed up to Resend with.
# RESEND_FROM_EMAIL=Nosvra Website <hello@nosvra.com>

# Optional. Overrides where contact-form enquiries are delivered, without changing
# the public-facing address shown on the contact page (lib/data/site.ts). Useful
# for testing against a personal inbox before switching to a verified domain.
CONTACT_TO_EMAIL=nosvra.tech@gmail.com
